{"id":"63dae0878804611a","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Scale Bad Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Bad Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Bad Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-scale-bad-point — ZFC Pcf3 Scale Bad Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> are the limit-ordinal predicate and guarded cofinality operator</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleBadPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleBadPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}bad\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleBadPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\vec f)\n\\land\\delta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\neg\\exists X,Z,B_Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\subseteq\\delta\\land\\bigcup X=\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Z,X,B_Z)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;(Z(\\alpha)\\in J)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\forall a\\in A\\setminus(Z(\\alpha)\\cup Z(\\beta))\\;\n(\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}scale\\text{-}bad\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ScaleBadPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),\\vec f)\n\\land\\delta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\neg\\exists X,Z,B_Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\subseteq\\delta\\land\\bigcup X=\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Z,X,B_Z)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;(Z(\\alpha)\\in J)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\forall a\\in A\\setminus(Z(\\alpha)\\cup Z(\\beta))\\;\n(\\vec f(\\alpha)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(a))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cardinal witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\\)</span> spells out <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\">\\(|A|&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)\\)</span> without an undeclared cardinality operator.  The function-coded unbounded set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and exceptions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(\\alpha)\\in J\">\\(Z(\\alpha)\\in J\\)</span> state precisely the usual good-point witness whose nonexistence defines a bad point.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","